Architecture: all
Depends: bash, coreutils, git, ca-certificates, dkms, build-essential, linux-firmware, pciutils, usbutils, ethtool, network-manager, kmod, mokutil, systemd, util-linux
Maintainer: MacBookPro13,2 community integration <maintainers@invalid.example>
Description: MacBook T1 beta integration and kernel update monitor
 Installs the Touch Bar driver from pinned community source after explicit
 approval on eligible 2016–2017 T1 models. The existing Cirrus audio and
 BCM43602 Wi-Fi setup is limited to MacBookPro13,2. For Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.
